      <h1>Test Your <em>Gold Deposit</em> Before Buying</h1>
      <p>Don't spend $30K-$150K on equipment based on guesswork. Learn proven methods to evaluate your deposit's gold content and avoid costly mistakes that bankrupt mining operations.</p>
